names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Armatis</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Zarandi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Varga</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Halmos</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Inhibition of growth of experimental human endometrial cancer by an antagonist of growth hormone-releasing hormone</article-title><source>J Clin Endocrinol Metab</source><year>2005</year><volume>90</volume><fpage>3614</fpage><lpage>3621</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Clin Endocrinol Metab||90|3614||bib7|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gaylinn</surname><given-names>BD</given-names></name><name><surname>Harrison</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>Zysk</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Lyons</surname><given-names>CE</given-names></name><name><surname>Lynch</surname><given-names>KR</given-names></name><name><surname>Thorner</surname><given-names>MO</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Molecular cloning and expression of a human anterior pituitary receptor for growth hormone-releasing hormone</article-title><source>Mol Endocrinol</source><year>1993</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>77</fpage><lpage>84</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Mol Endocrinol||7|77||bib8|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Halmos</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Schally</surname><given-names>AV</given-names></name><name><surname>Varga</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Plonowski</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Rekasi</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Czompoly</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title